&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;To learn more about why these skills matter and what the data shows about thriving through change, read this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot;&gt;blog post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt; our Chief People Officer, Melanie Rosenwasser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;US Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This role is not available in Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 2&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$143,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,600 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 3&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$127,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$173,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86zcvlz122zs3wgz73zz76zz70zhbz122zz78zloz87zz67zjh3xz86z8j4dz70z&quot;&gt;We are looking for a data-driven, systems-thinking Sales Operations Manager to own the operating infrastructure that powers our go-to-market engine. In this highly visible Individual Contributor role, you will serve as the backbone of a regional Sales organization and translate go-to-market strategy into an executable operating model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxwz73zz68ziz122zhv2z67zqodz78zz122zz122ztz88zdkz69zz68zz77zqg5vz66zsc18&quot;&gt;You will act as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxwz73zz68ziz122zhv2z67zqodz78zz122zz122ztz88zdkz69zz68zz77zqg5vz66zsc18&quot;&gt;the primary regional business partner for sales executives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86zcvlz122zs3wgz73zz76zz70zhbz122zz78zloz87zz67zjh3xz86z8j4dz70z&quot;&gt;, supporting all routes to market within the region. You will own or coordinate &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxwz73zz68ziz122zhv2z67zqodz78zz122zz122ztz88zdkz69zz68zz77zqg5vz66zsc18&quot;&gt;supporting sales planning, territory and quota execution, forecast interpretation, operational improvements, and translation of strategic priorities into clear execution plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86zcvlz122zs3wgz73zz76zz70zhbz122zz78zloz87zz67zjh3xz86z8j4dz70z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qoxwz73zz68ziz122zhv2z67zqodz78zz122zz122ztz88zdkz69zz68zz77zqg5vz66zsc18&quot;&gt;You’ll drive process clarity, pipeline health, forecasting hygiene, and cross-functional governance, using AI and automation-enabled workflows to reduce manual reporting effort while maintaining strong human judgment over business recommendations. &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86zcvlz122zs3wgz73zz76zz70zhbz122zz78zloz87zz67zjh3xz86z8j4dz70z&quot;&gt;Your top priority each day will be to ensure excellence in execution and reporting on our regional goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz66zwhdz68zz78zz74zl2vz70z03z66zz80zrz77zt56z90zz81zz74zz69zpz80zkf&quot;&gt;Own the operating cadence, including territory management, account segmentation, forecasting governance, pipeline inspection, business reviews, and performance visibility, delivering executive-ready insights that drive forecast accuracy, balanced sales coverage, and operational excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86zcvlz122zs3wgz73zz76zz70zhbz122zz78zloz87zz67zjh3xz86z8j4dz70z&quot;&gt;.Partner with regional Sales leaders across all routes to market to improve forecast accuracy, pipeline health, sales coverage, deal quality, and operational execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86zcvlz122zs3wgz73zz76zz70zhbz122zz78zloz87zz67zjh3xz86z8j4dz70z&quot;&gt;Work in close partnership with the Chief Business Officer’s organization and the GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Programs team to connect regional Sales Operations to company-wide priorities, provide timely inputs for executive reporting, and ensure consistency across regional and corporate operating cadences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end coverage design, including segmentation, book cutting, territory planning, account assignment, capacity planning, and quota allocation in partnership with Sales Leadership, Compensation, Finance, Systems, and Analytics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Own CRM QA and hygiene for the supported region, including SFDC hierarchy management, pipeline quality, process compliance, forecast integrity, deal quality investigations, and exception resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Partner with leadership on pipeline inspection, forecasting, and opportunity assessment, and build executive-ready reporting, dashboards, MBR/QBR readouts, and business insights that help leaders identify risks and make better decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Partner with Sales Strategy, Systems, Analytics, Compensation, Finance, and Enablement to automate recurring workflows and continuously improve how the team operates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Support organization design, interim coverage plans, role changes, new-hire onboarding, SPIF development and administration, and Channel deal registration as part of the regional operating model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-579881870255305228911086 author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84zhz75z1z69z2z67zz75zq4z65zudz69zz81z4z89zhz66zrz89zu8vkwz71zz78zfr&quot;&gt;Proven experience scaling Sales Operations across Europe, supporting a complex, multi-country sales organization with diverse markets, languages, and evolving go-to-market motions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-884672691854386969095228 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz66zwhdz68zz78zz74zl2vz70z03z66zz80zrz77zt56z90zz81zz74zz69zpz80zkf&quot;&gt;Professional working proficiency in English is required as this role regularly collaborates with global teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-343185066871235603444289 attrcomment attrcommentfirst thread-343185066871235603444289-first author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-343185066871235603444289 attrcomment author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84zhz75z1z69z2z67zz75zq4z65zudz69zz81z4z89zhz66zrz89zu8vkwz71zz78zfr&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-343185066871235603444289 attrcomment author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt; years of experience in sales operations, business strategy, investment banking, venture capital, private equity, or corporate advisory, or 6 years of experience with an advanced degree.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84zhz75z1z69z2z67zz75zq4z65zudz69zz81z4z89zhz66zrz89zu8vkwz71zz78zfr&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt; years of experience working with executive stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-688237985174657727228097 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Experience leading territory planning, account segmentation, forecasting, pipeline inspection, and annual sales planning processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-688237985174657727228097 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of quota planning, sales capacity modeling, and quota governance, with the ability to align quotas to business strategy and commercial objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz82zfwz66zwhdz68zz78zz74zl2vz70z03z66zz80zrz77zt56z90zz81zz74zz69zpz80zkf&quot;&gt;Experience using AI, automation, and analytics tools to improve forecasting, pipeline inspection, reporting, and workflow efficiency, with the ability to validate outputs and apply sound business judgment before making recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;The role can be based in either the UK or Ireland.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Experience supporting executive operating cadences&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(e.g.,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt; Weekly Business Reviews, Forecast Calls, Quarterly Business Reviews) for senior sales leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Experience designing or optimizing territory, account segmentation, or book-of-business models for high-growth SaaS organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Experience developing quota methodologies, allocating quotas, and partnering with Sales Leadership and Finance to align quotas with territory design, capacity planning, and business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Experience supporting multiple sales motions&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(Direct,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt; Channel, Self-Serve, Enterprise) across global or multi-region organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency with Salesforce, Tableau, SQL, or similar business intelligence and CRM platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz80zsz86z2n7z83zbz85zez68zz66znel3z82zz89z5z66zz85zz85z0ce6z85zz89zs5z81z&quot;&gt;Experience operating in a high-growth or transformational environment where Sales Operations played a strategic role in scaling the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
