&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;To learn more about why these skills matter and what the data shows about thriving through change, read this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;attrlink url author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;attrlink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-target-href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.jobs/en/our-blog/employee-stories/the-era-of-durable-skills-what-the-data-tells-us-about-thriving-in-change/&quot;&gt;blog post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84z5u1z69zz90zlz73z3ly1nz76zw1r5kz89zz66z4z65zz65zjz122zf092&quot;&gt; our Chief People Officer, Melanie Rosenwasser.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;US Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;This role is not available in Zone 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 2&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$143,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,600 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Zone 3&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$127,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$173,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Dropbox’s Virtual First team researches, tests, and scales better ways of working for a distributed organization. We combine organizational research, experimentation, behavioral science, technology, and employee experience to continuously improve how Dropboxers work—wherever they are.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;As a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Program Manager, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4z67zz65zjz78z1z69zdz122zluz90zz84zl0r58z82zcz78z2z90zz66zz79zz90zlz84zz89zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-419455047293582289541930 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;you will own a strategic Virtual First work stream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt; focused on tool optimization and technology-enabled ways of working, identifying opportunities to improve employee effectiveness and translating those opportunities into research, experiments, recommendations, and scalable organizational change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;This role combines program management with research, innovation, and cross-functional stakeholder management. You will manage a portfolio of interconnected programs rather than a single project, with particular focus on knowledge management, AI enablement, and building employee confidence with tools and technology. You will establish research priorities, design and facilitate experiments, synthesize findings, and work with partners across Dropbox to turn evidence into better ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Success in this role means creating new knowledge, translating that knowledge into clear recommendations, and driving measurable improvements in employee effectiveness, tool confidence, and adoption of AI-enabled and technology-supported ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Own the strategy, roadmap, priorities, and outcomes of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-247974806874704427481119 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Virtual First work&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;thread-247974806874704427481119 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;stream focused on technology, including tools, workflows, automations, AI enablement, and knowledge management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Design and lead organizational research, pilots, and experiments that test new ways of working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Translate qualitative and quantitative findings into actionable recommendations, behavioral frameworks, and operating models for downstream adoption&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Manage a portfolio of concurrent programs and initiatives from initial scoping through research, validation, and enablement planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Establish clear objectives, success measures, milestones, risks, and reporting across the work&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;stream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Facilitate cross-functional Steering Committees and initiatives involving stakeholders across People, Technology, Communications, Operations, and other business functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Partner with People Analytics and other measurement experts to establish research methodologies and evaluate outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-980582739475638929887716 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;+ years &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;of experience in program management, organizational effectiveness, workplace strategy, employee experience, innovation, research, or a related discipline.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Expertise in tools and technology enablement, including AI adoption, knowledge management, digital workflows, automation, and the design of technology-enabled ways of working that improve employee effectiveness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience independently leading complex, cross-functional programs from ambiguity through measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Experience designing and managing research, pilots, experiments, or other evidence-based innovation programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of Virtual First, distributed, hybrid, or modern ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Excellent written, verbal, facilitation, and executive communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Comfort working in ambiguity and proactively identifying opportunities rather than waiting for assignments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Experience working in a distributed or Virtual First organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Experience with organizational behavior, change management, behavioral science, workplace research, or human-centered design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zbtz90zz66zc7z122zz78zz73zz76zvogdz71zmqz67zz87zy8z90zz67zz71zz83zz84zz65zz83zz75z&quot;&gt;Demonstrated curiosity about the future of work and emerging technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Durable Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;AI fluency means using these tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;amplify&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; human judgment, not replace it. We believe people with these skills will thrive as work and technology&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;continue to evolve:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
